@startuml
title Sequence Diagram — Template Method after Strategy Selection\nUser selects "Most Liked Photo" and clicks Analyze

actor User
participant ": FormMain" as Form
participant "r_StrategyProvider : PhotoAnalysisStrategyProvider" as Provider
participant "feature : MaxScorePhotoFeature\n(MostLikedPhotoFeature)" as Feature
participant ": CachingFacebookProxy" as Proxy
participant ": FacebookService" as FB

User -> Form : buttonAnalyzePhoto_Click()
Form -> Provider : GetStrategy("Most Liked Photo")
note right
  ** Strategy Pattern step **
  Selects the concrete feature.
  Template Method starts when
  Execute(user) is called.
end note
Provider --> Form : MostLikedPhotoFeature

Form -> Form : runPhotoAnalysis(feature)
note right : wraps in Decorators\nthen calls Execute(user)

Form -> Feature : Execute(user)
note right
  ** Template Method **
  Execute() is defined in MaxScorePhotoFeature.
  Algorithm is fixed here:
  loop albums -> loop photos -> getScore()
end note

Feature -> Proxy : GetAlbums()
Proxy --> Feature : List<Album>

loop [for each Album in albums]
    Feature -> Proxy : GetPhotosFromAlbum(album)
    Proxy -> FB : album.Photos
    note right of FB : Graph API call\n(takes time)
    FB --> Proxy : PhotoCollection
    Proxy --> Feature : List<Photo>

    loop [for each Photo in photos]
        Feature -> Feature : getScore(photo)
        note right
          ** Primitive Operation **
          Overridden in MostLikedPhotoFeature:
          returns photo.LikedBy.Count
        end note
    end
end

Feature --> Form : Photo (most liked)
Form -> Form : displayPhotoResult(photo)
Form --> User : photo displayed

@enduml
